[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25801.15, "timestamp": "07:10:01", "text": "1990年。我忘了。等等，我知道是在之前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25803.868, "timestamp": "07:10:03", "text": "2000年。是的，我知道那是以前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25808.35, "timestamp": "07:10:08", "text": "2000年，因为那时候我还没出生呢。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25812.07, "timestamp": "07:10:12", "text": "是的。嗯，是的，在 M 和那些东西之前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25816.03, "timestamp": "07:10:16", "text": "大概是管理之类的吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25824.788, "timestamp": "07:10:24", "text": "是的，肯定会这样。是的，必须是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25830.628, "timestamp": "07:10:30", "text": "所以，我家以前就靠那点东西生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25833.51, "timestamp": "07:10:33", "text": "楼上部分，就是我之前展示过的那部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25835.27, "timestamp": "07:10:35", "text": "不是那样的。简直就像完全"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25838.59, "timestamp": "07:10:38", "text": "不同的。他们以前常住在楼上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25841.27, "timestamp": "07:10:41", "text": "我认为他们把它给了里诺"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25843.59, "timestamp": "07:10:43", "text": "楼下用的东西。然后他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25845.99, "timestamp": "07:10:45", "text": "改了一下。楼下成了我们的地盘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25850.15, "timestamp": "07:10:50", "text": "然后我们把它给了更多的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25854.91, "timestamp": "07:10:54", "text": "公司需要租用办公室之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25858.23, "timestamp": "07:10:58", "text": "东西。然后然后然后呃他们"}]